<title>USA: J.Avery to run Fidelity Select Regional Banks fund.</title>
<headline>J.Avery to run Fidelity Select Regional Banks fund.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity Investments said Tuesday it named John Avery portfolio manager of Fidelity Select Regional Banks Portfolio, effective Sept 23.</p>
<p>Fidelity said in a statement Avery replaced Remy Trafelet, who was leaving to pursue another opportunity.</p>
<p>Avery would continue to manage Fidelity Select Chemicals Portfolio, the company said.</p>
<p>--New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
